# Basic smoke script for lux-core-cli: open a file, edit it, undo/redo,
# and assert the buffer text at each step. Exercises Buffer, Edit,
# Transaction, and History together end-to-end, with no UI involved.

open basic.txt
assert_eq hello world

insert 5 ,
assert_eq hello, world

delete 5 1
assert_eq hello world

undo
assert_eq hello, world

redo
assert_eq hello world

dump
